{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50637","headline":"题云居上寺 · 轩辕伟","name":"题云居上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不着登山屐，扪萝也上跻。\n石梁分鸟道，苔迳过云霓。\n梵宇千花里，秋声万籁齐。\n[周]游兴未尽，钟磬度前溪。\n（见《金石萃编》卷一百五。）\n（缺字据吉逾条下所引诸书补。\n下同。\n）（〖1〗石刻诗次吉逾诗後，原题曰「同作」，下署轩辕伟，无官衔。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"轩辕伟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}